   "how": "Found in the Goddess's Rest location on Yaesha. Go left from the main entrance to Lydusa Temple with the 5 blue circles and take the elevator down. Follow the path until you reach a water path with a cave entrance on the left. At the far back of the passage to the left will be a false wall leading to a room containing an elevator. Take the elevator and follow the passage. The heart will be on your right, opposite of the bedchamber.",
