   "how": "Found in an outdoor location on Yaesha. There will be a tower with an elevator in the area. If you step on and off the elevator, it will raise, revealing symbols you will need to enter into the puzzle lock. Go downstairs to the foot of the tower from the elevator and through the illusory wall in front of the tower, enter the symbols (in any order) on the lock and the door to the item will get unlocked",
   "drop": "Event: Quest Injectable Islands Tower",
