   "how": "Found in the Forlorn Coast location on Losomn. Talk to One True King and agree to kill Nimue. Get to Nimue's tower via Palace of the One True King, you need to go upstairs, then drop from a balcony and then go downstairs to get access to Nimue's tower. Descend the tower, talk to Nimue and choose the option to kill her",
