   "world": "World_DLC3",
   "cls": "Relic_Consumable_GossamerHeart",
   "key": "/Game/World_DLC3/Items/Relics/GossamerHeart/Relic_Consumable_GossamerHeart.Relic_Consumable_GossamerHeart_C",
   "how": "Found in an indoor location on N'Erud. There will be a circular area where you pick up the Crop Sample quest item, and at the side of this area there will be an elevator going down. In the room after you exit the elevator, place the Crop Sample on the blue statue. Return when you have killed a boss to get the item",
