   "how": "Found in the Withered Necropolis location on N'Erud. Somewhat tricky to find, watching a video is recommended. From the Waylaid Conservatory world stone follow the wall on the left until you get to a glider. Take a glider to the bridge below, and fight your way to the left of the bridge until the very end, there will be a drop there and a platform with the glider station across that drop. You won't be able to jump across from there but that platform is where you need to go, so you can orient yourself on the minimap. Backtrack along the bridge, take the first right and then there will be an elevator up on the left. Take the elevator, and hug the left wall until you get to a glider. Take the glider and take a sharp left until you arrive at the wind plume next to your target platform and get over there. There will be a short corridor from there leading to a room where the item can be found",
