   "how": "Drops from The Prototype aberration in the Agronomy Sector location on N'Erud. To fight the aberration, four spare parts must first be found: the Prototype Claw, Prototype Head, Prototype Arm, and Prototype Memory Core. The Memory Core must remain switched to the default (red) setting when inserted. The Prototype Head is found in the Agronomy Sector location on N'Erud. Next to the Quiescent Overlook world stone, directly at the beginning of the story this item can be collected at the crash site of the railcar. The Prototype Arm is found in the Agronomy Sector location on N'Erud. Take the glider at Anterior Recess world stone and glide down towards a cave to your right. You might be able to see a faint red glow from the glider position. The Prototype Claw is found in the Withered Necropolis location on N'Erud. From the Waylaid Conservatory world stone take the path on the left of the Gardener until you reach a glider. Glide down to the bridge. Go to the left and follow the tunnel to the end of the bridge and collect the Prototype Claw. The Prototype Memory Core is found in the Withered Necropolis location on N'Erud. Take the closest glider from the Waylaid Conservatory world stone, glide all the way down the canyon until you hit the first wind plume, turn left; there will be a small landing down there where the item is",
