   "how": "Found in the Agronomy Sector and Withered Necropolis locations on N'Erud. Obtained by activating consoles next to all three of the purple pillars, two in the Agronomy Sector and another one in Withered Necropolis. You can get to the first pillar from the Anterior Recess world stone, head outside and follow the right path, continue until you reach a glider spot, hop onto the glider and drop straight down. For the first pillar start at the Propagation Field world stone, hang an immediate left and work your way through the corn field on your left, continue to the glider spot and you'll see the second pillar across the chasm. Take the glider to reach it. For the third pillar take the closest glider from the Waylaid Conservatory world stone, glide all the way down the canyon until you hit the first wind plume, turn right and hit the next wind plume just around the corner, and then the next one in the same direction. The small platform (with a sort of short broken bridge sticking out of it) will be immediately next to that last plume. Land on it, go under the arch and to the right until you reach the pillar",
