   "how": "Found in the Council Chamber location on Losomn. Talk to the Council and agree to identify the traitor. Complete the level and transition to the Council Tribunal location by interacting with the mirror at the end of the location. Then proceed until you reach council seats and interact with them to obtain the council key quest items. Put the keys back into the seats in the correct order from left to right: teal, red and purple. This will open the throne room, go there and climb onto the ledge behind the throne, and jump to the back of the throne from there. Pick up the Assassin Dagger quest item, and inspect it, noticing the colour of the jewel on it. Return to the Council Chamber and when asked to accuse, accuse the person corresponding to the Dagger's jewel colour: teal - Savan, red - Oniril, purple - Nyele. The item will be given as the reward for the correct accusation",
